flowchart TD
MOO_Orchestrator["**MOO Orchestrator**<br/>run_moo_optimization entry point<br/>configures algorithm and parallel pool<br/>triggers optimization and saves CSV"]
BufferProblem["**BufferOptimizationProblem**<br/>Problem subclass for pymoo<br/>n_var 6<br/>n_obj 2<br/>xl {1-10}<br/>xu {1-10}<br/>type_var int<br/>method _evaluate calls evaluate_design"]
NSGA2_Algo["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>population size 50<br/>sampling crossover mutation<br/>eliminate duplicates"]
PoolNode["**Parallel Pool**<br/>multiprocessing Pool size 50<br/>used by pymoo evaluator"]
MinimizeCall["**Optimizer Run**<br/>minimize problem using algorithm<br/>termination generation 50<br/>evaluator type parallel pool"]
EvaluateDesign["**evaluate_design**<br/>maps design vector x to objectives<br/>runs REPLICATIONS simulations and averages KPIs<br/>returns [wip, -throughput]"]
DecisionVars["**Decision Variables**<br/>buffer capacities list<br/>post_loading post_conveyor post_washing<br/>pre_press1 pre_press2 post_press12<br/>domain {1-10} integer"]
RunSimCaps["**run_simulation_with_capacities**<br/>builds simpy model using decision caps<br/>executes simulation until measure end<br/>returns overall KPIs and machine energy"]
RunSimCore["**Simulation Core**<br/>part generation and sampling WIP every 600 seconds<br/>computes throughput and average WIP<br/>warmup reset statistics"]
DelayBufferClass["**DelayBuffer class**<br/>attributes cap delay store tokens in_transit<br/>methods put get free_capacity in_transit_count"]
MachineClass["**Machine class**<br/>attributes name input_buffer output_buffer process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power capacity<br/>methods run breakdown_cycle waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption"]
ResultsWriter["**Results Writer**<br/>collects population history<br/>filters infeasible solutions<br/>writes unique rows to CSV results"]
Objectives["**Objectives**<br/>f1 minimize wip<br/>f2 maximize throughput implemented as minimize negative throughput"]
Constants["**Global Constants**<br/>RANDOM_SEED 99<br/>REPLICATIONS 10<br/>SIM_TIME 691200 WARMUP 86400"]

